  ($tfq$q-tf004-71$tfq$, $tfq$terraform-associate-004$tfq$, $tfq$Hard$tfq$, $tfq$single$tfq$, $tfq$A team wants to test a deployed endpoint after apply but receive a warning rather than block the operation when the endpoint check fails. Which feature is designed for this?$tfq$, $tfq$A resource precondition$tfq$, $tfq$An input-variable validation$tfq$, $tfq$A check block assertion$tfq$, $tfq$A provider version constraint$tfq$, NULL, NULL, 2, ARRAY[2]::INTEGER[], $tfq$A check block validates infrastructure outside the normal resource lifecycle and reports a warning when its assertion fails. Preconditions and variable validation can block the associated operation.$tfq$, $tfq$tf004-configuration$tfq$),
