  ($tfq$q-tf004-96$tfq$, $tfq$terraform-associate-004$tfq$, $tfq$Medium$tfq$, $tfq$multiple$tfq$, $tfq$Which two HCP Terraform capabilities support reuse and governance across teams? Select two.$tfq$, $tfq$A private module and provider Registry$tfq$, $tfq$Policy checks integrated into run workflows$tfq$, $tfq$One shared administrator login for every workspace$tfq$, $tfq$Automatic removal of historical state versions$tfq$, $tfq$Credentials embedded in reusable module source code$tfq$, NULL, 0, ARRAY[0, 1]::INTEGER[], $tfq$The private Registry helps teams publish approved reusable modules and providers, while policy checks apply governance to runs. Shared accounts and embedded credentials undermine controlled collaboration.$tfq$, $tfq$tf004-hcp$tfq$),
